    {
      "text": "Oil for the light, spices for anointing oil, Ex. 25:6. shalt thou take the anointing oil, Ex. 29:7 (Lev. 8:12). thou shalt make it an oil of holy ointment, Ex. 30:25 (37:29). with the oil for the light, Ex. 35:14. priest shall put of the oil … upon the tip of the right ear, Lev. 14:28. Samuel took a vial of oil, and poured it, 1 Sam. 10:1. priest took an horn of oil out of the tabernacle, 1 Kgs. 1:39. a barrel, and a little oil in a cruse, 1 Kgs. 17:12. any thing in the house, save a pot of oil, 2 Kgs. 4:2. poured the oil on his head, 2 Kgs. 9:6. thou anointest my head with oil, Ps. 23:5. anointed thee with the oil of gladness, Ps. 45:7 (Heb. 1:9).",
